# Cloudflare Pages _redirects
#
# Astro builds static per-route HTML files, so a SPA wildcard fallback is NOT
# needed. Each route (/, /projects, /resume, /contact, etc.) has its own
# index.html in dist/.
#
# Add old-URL → new-URL 301 redirects here as the site grows.
# Format: <source>  <destination>  <status>
#
# Example (uncomment when old URLs exist):
# /old-path/*  /new-path/:splat  301
